# Submodule declarations intentionally left empty for this fork.
#
# The upstream Biji-Biji-Initiative/mereka-lms repo registers:
#   - hubspot-webhook-mct → private Biji-Biji repo Netlify cannot access
#   - tmp/frontend-app-authn → Open edX MFE (only used for local reference)
#
# For this prototype fork, we deploy a static UX prototype via Netlify, so
# no submodules are needed. Removing these entries unblocks Netlify builds
# that were failing at the "preparing repo" stage due to the private
# hubspot-webhook-mct submodule.
#
# If you ever need to sync upstream changes that rely on these submodules,
# re-add them here and make sure Netlify has access (or use
# `GIT_CLONE_OPTIONS="--no-recurse-submodules"` in Netlify env vars).
